<code>assert index >= 0 && index <= \old(this.size()) && role != null => \forall int i; index <= i && i < \old(this.size()); (this.get(i).equals(\old(this.get(i+1))) || (\old(this.get(i+1)) == null && this.get(i) == null));</code>

This assert statement captures the condition that for every valid index from the insertion point to the old size of the list, the element at the next position is either null if the old element was null or equals the old element at that position.
